sequenceDiagram
 participant O as "관찰 producer"
 participant C as "F018 Coordinator"
 participant M as "Main cleanup checkpoints"
 participant N as "camera/native/location owner"
 participant P as "중단 marker 저장"
 O->>C: "현재 epoch의 unsafe observation"
 C->>C: "cause latch·출력 차단 먼저 확정"
 C->>M: "lock 밖 onSafeStop with completion"
 M->>M: "lifecycle SAFE_STOP·output/network/input fence"
 M->>N: "cancel intent 및 실제 drain/close 요청"
 N-->>M: "실제 release 결과"
 M->>P: "idempotent marker commit"
 P-->>M: "commit 결과"
 alt "필수 정리 모두 성공"
  M-->>C: "completion true"
  C->>C: "delivery 완료, 새 walk 검토 가능"
 else "실패·시도 예산 남음"
  M-->>C: "completion false"
  C->>M: "250ms 뒤 checkpoint 재시도"
  Note over M,N: "불확실한 non-idempotent native close는 재실행하지 않음"
 else "총3회 소진 또는 scheduler 없음"
  C->>C: "EXHAUSTED·새 활성화 차단"
 end
 O->>C: "추가 원인"
 C-->>M: "원인 합집합 갱신, cleanup 무조건 반복 안 함"
